{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["Seven days you shall fill their hand — seven days before the eighth day, when the service was performed by Aharon and his sons. Moshe would set up the Mishkan each day and offer sacrifices each day, and at evening he would dismantle it. And on the eighth day, which is the first of Nisan, the Mishkan was erected permanently, as written in אלה פקודי. And from here onward the service was by Aharon and his sons."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:34.596907296Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}